### YT Summarizer API — Test File
### Install "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Summarize a video (paste any YouTube URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/summarize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gfr50f6ZBvo"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Ask a question about the video
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gfr50f6ZBvo",
  "question": "What are the main topics discussed in this video?"
}
